ar night when he can't sleep he  actually is confronted with the quite  terrifying looking spirit of merle  blatty himself who  appears as like a charred corpse because  that's how he died like he burned up  like that like he's a nice ghost and  everything but he can't help like the  way he looks and he just keeps getting  burned like over and over and that's  what he looks like he looks all melted  and [ __ ] so he shows up and he basically  tells daniel um you have to read through  all of the journals that i left behind  like in this other trunk that's like in  this secret room with me and you have to  figure out how to seal this well that's  in the basement because of course it is  a gateway to hell so daniel ends up  finding the old man's journals and a  bunch of videotapes of all his previous  exorcisms like over the past however  many years i think he started  videotaping them in the 80s and daniel  starts to become like obsessed with  going through them  meanwhile the demon from the well is  kind of [ __ ] with everybody's minds  making them see like really really  horrible [ __ ] uh you know stuff that  isn't there like making them see family  members doing stuff that they're not  doing and all this other kind of stuff  apparently it seems like just trying to  so chaos and like trying to turn them  against one another things like that  so this kind of all keeps going until it  comes to a head and then that leads up  to this big kind of classic exorcism  battle royale between the family and  then this priest that they summon who  had actually known merle and like  trained him a long time ago and so  they're kind of fighting this demon  that's inhabiting this well in the  basement and the whole scene like at the  end it's very very very classic like i  said exorcism stuff there's levitations  and fire and like people with like fire  in their eyes [ __ ] up visions and  gloppy black substances driven from the  ceiling all that kind of crazy [ __ ] so  as i said